window.products.push({"id":728058,"name":"YIZAO Non Stick Divided Grill Fry Oven Skillet Square Cookware Frying Pan 10.5 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718v+qe3UeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"More details  1.Multi-functional cookware,4 sections,you can fry egg,bacon, steak, salmon, vegetables etc at same time  2.When ready to use, lightly coat the entire interior cooking surface with cooking oil or shortening and wipe with a paper towel, repeat as necessary for a longer lasting non stick surface 4.Convenient detachable handle with hanging hole, save storage space Using attentions  1.Never use mental utensils they will scratch the non stick surface,only use plastic, rubber, wooden or silicone cooking utensils 2.Cleaning: before use please clean the cooking pan and base of the product with a hot dishcloth or sponge, after use do not pour cold water onto the product, as the sudden temperature change may damage the non stick surface 2.Warranty: 1 year limited warranty for any defeats in material and workmanship About our factory  Hangzhou OUGE Electrical Appliance CO., LTD was developed by a group which specialized in designing, producing and selling electrical appliance team which was formed in 2000. we gained our reputation from costumers in Japan, Southeast Asia, U.S., Europe, Australia, South America, at the same time, we also cooperated with many other Japanese well-known enterprises and won our customers' trust all over the world. Quality policy based on \"People-oriented, innovation and development, the quality of survival and customer comes the first\". In our factory, we have the most domestic advanced production equipments. Our production system includes aluminum alloy die-casting, painting, hardware, injection, thermostat and small house appliance assembly. We constantly improving our QMS, had gained ISO9001:2008 certificate, and our productions have various certification in kinds of markets, including GS, JET, ETL, and CCC. We also have our own proprietary intellectual property rights, covering over ten patent for utility models and over one hundred appearance patent.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718v+qe3UeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YIZAO","source_asin":"B07L5B6TVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L5B6TVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L5B6TVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
