window.products.push({"id":728110,"name":"Star Moon Dreamcatcher 2pcs, Teen Girl Room Decor,Macrame Wall Hanging for Baby Girl Gifts,4~10 Year Old Girl Gift Ideas, for mom, Boho Dream Catcher ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GV2GjIwBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The material of the dream catcher is Eco-friendly! Sleep peacefully knowing that your dream catcher is made from earth-friendly materials.Every feather is carefully selected.Dream catchers are carefully handcrafted to ensure strength and durability. It will strongly retain your good dreams, and let the bad ones slide away!The color will never fade ,they can last the whole season,and contiually be used next year. 【SYMBOLIC MEANING OF DREAM CATCHERS 】Dream catcher has the meaning of praying for peace and bringing good luck. It hangs in the children's room and can drive away nightmares, making people dream of falling asleep. It can also be hung on the car for good luck! 【BEAUTIFUL HOME DECOR】Do you want better vibes in your room? Just imagine your room’s wall elegantly draped with this unique dream catcher. Or, maybe its your child’s room, and he is sleeping peacefully under the dream catcher. Or maybe it can be hung on the garden. Either way, you came to the right place. This beautiful, handmade dream catcher will bring you the vibes that you’re searching for. 【THE STORY OF DREAM CATCHERS】 The Native American Indians believed that Dream catchers caught negative dreams in their web like structure and held them until daylight when the sunlight hit them at dawn, the negative energy caught in the web was destroyed.There is a round hole in the middle of the net. It is said that only a good dream can pass through the hole and stay behind the feathers, but the nightmare will be trapped in the net and disappear with the sunshine of the next day. 【TOP GIFTS OR MEMORIAL WIND CHIMES】The gentle dream catchers is the best gift for girlfriend, wife's wedding anniversary, child's birthday,mother's birthday, or Mother's Day, Father's Day,Thanksgiving Day,Valentine's Day and Christmas","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GV2GjIwBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShangTianFeng","source_asin":"B07SZD4Z27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728110","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SZD4Z27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SZD4Z27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
