window.products.push({"id":728211,"name":"Infinity Instruments Retro Redux Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gcimPICHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Infinity Instruments Retro Wall Clock collection has been a staple in the interior design/ wall décor accessories for well over a decade.  It has proven the test of time with a clean retro look that fits most, if not all, home décor layouts. There have been many copy cats but there is only one true  Retro Iron Wall Clock.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gcimPICHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Infinity Instruments","source_asin":"B0007R9LC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0007R9LC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0007R9LC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728212,"name":"Towa Anzawa-Do Tetsubin Cast Iron Teapot with Stainless Steel Infuser Japanese Tea Kettle (29oz) 0.8L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71twD+vCRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Uncoated Cast Iron Teapot Anzawa-Do cast iron teapots deliver a feeling of warmth. It can retains heat and strengthen the flavor of the tea. Especially suitable for those who love drinking tea and interested in Japanese tea ceremony. Since our iron teapots are uncoated, care should be taken during daily use. No coating means that it is healthy for the human body, and it is also necessary to do a good job of daily rust removal and maintenance HOW TO USE ME PROPERLY TO AVOID RUST? Step1: It can only be used for steeping the tea or just boiling the water and pour it into the cup to brew tea. And it is not advisable to leave the tea or water inside too long. Step2: Cast iron teapot should be completely drained after use and dried by returning the item to the stovetop where residual heat on the burner will evaporate any remaining moisture. You can also use your mouth to blow on the inner wall of teapot to speed up the evaporation of water. Step3: Take the lid off while the teapot is drying, then use soft cloth to wipe the lid. Dishwashing detergent is not recommended, simply clean the teapot with water. Step4: Please do not wash or rub the teapot inside or outside with a sponge, detergent, brush or cleaning implement.You may polish the surface of the teapot with a lightly squeezed soft cloth, which has been soaked with tea as this will help to keep it looking glossy. When First Use: Put 5-10 grams of tea into the iron pot and brewing for about 10 minutes. Pour away the water when boiled, some turbidity will be present initially, so heat and rinse the teapot several times with fresh water until the water runs clear from the pot. Wonderful Gift Pack safely in a well-wrapped box. It is a nice gift for housewarming, wedding or anniversary and the BEST GIFT for the tea lover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71twD+vCRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Towa","source_asin":"B08QMXKSQF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QMXKSQF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QMXKSQF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
