window.products.push({"id":728303,"name":"Balloon Arch Kit Balloon Garland Kit Accessories, Supplies with Strips, Hand Pump, Tie Tool, Glue Dot, Hooks, and Fishing Line Easy to Setup Balloon D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZ+hu2U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to Use 1. blow up your balloons with the hand pump and tie them. If you already purchased an electric balloon pump, it will make inflating fast and easy. Important TIP 1- Inflating balloons completely full will make full inner pressure. They are more likely to pop that way. Before you tie balloons, we recommend letting a little air out after inflating, and make shape of balloons as close to circle shape as possible than oval shape. TIP 2 - Make various balloon sizes to create your garland stylish. TIP 3 - Using a balloon tying tool (provided) will allow saving your time and knotting pain-free. 2. Pull the knot of the balloons into one of the holes in the balloon strip. Get creative by alternating colors. TIP 4 - We recommend you to skip a few holes and place some 5” balloons into the strip to make your garland more organic looking. 3. Once you have your balloons attached to the strip, it’s time to hang to the place where you want to place your garland. (To get the desired design of your garland, we recommend hanging first, and then fill in with the smaller balloons.) TIP 5 -If you've got rigging points, use the fishing line to the end of the strip in a loop and tie tightly to the points. If not, attach with the hooks to the wall. 4. Once you secure the garland, fill in the gaps with the balloons to the strip using glue dot 5. Finally, fill in any gaps by using fishing line or glue dot with confetti balloons and mylar balloons and the rest balloons And there you have it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MZ+hu2U2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BALLOON MONSTER","source_asin":"B08J4CHM86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J4CHM86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J4CHM86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
