window.products.push({"id":728344,"name":"Robot Vacuum, Strong Suction, Quiet, Super-Thin Smart Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, Used to Clean Pet Hair, Hard Floors (26X5.5, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41l+Y3BhZzL._AC_.jpg","description":"Special Note: Do Not Add Water To The Water Tank Before Cleaning With A Robot Vacuum Cleaner. Since Wetting Will Accumulate Water On The Ground, The Water Will Stick Hair And Garbage To The Ground, Making It More Difficult For The Robot Vacuum Cleaner To Absorb The Hair And Garbage Sticking To The Ground. And It Attracts Water Droplets To The Dust Cover Of The Trash Can. This Will Reduce The Suction Power Of The Robot Vacuum Cleaner. After Cleaning, Add Water To The Water Tank For The Final Professional Wet Mop Sensing and removing the dust detection sensor will warn the robot to pay attention to dirty places in the home (such as heavy traffic) and perform a thorough cleaning. It will rotate for a long time and will not leave until the robot cleaner thinks it has been cleaned and is free of dirt. Notes: Whether It Is Carpet Or Tile, It Must Be Flat. If It Is Not Flat, When The Casters Of The Vacuum Cleaner Are Lower Than The Uneven Place, The Casters Will Float In The Air And Rotate, So It Will Not Move Forward So It Must Be Flat Mini Home Automatic Sweeping Vacuuming Robot Material: Abs Robot Vacuum Cleaner Color: White/Black Rated Power: 4.2w Rated Voltage: 3.5v Length: 26 * 5.5cm Weight: 1.35 Kg Use Area: 70-90square Meter Size: 26x26x5.5cm/10.2x10.2x2.7inch Quantity: 1pc Main Feature: Dust Box Can Be Disassembled, Easy To Clean And Reuse. It Can Proficiently Pick Up Hair, Dust And Dirt Under Your Sofa, Couch Or Areas That Are Hardly Reached. 5.5cm/2.7 Inch Thin Body, Easy To Cross Furniture, Bed Bottom, Cleaning More Comfortable. One Button Start, Dust And Hair Absorption, Automatic Direction Change, Etc. When Encountering Obstacles, It Will Rotate And Rely On The Bottom To Absorb Dust, Dust, Dog Hair And Floor Hair. Vacuum Cleaner Absorbent Fiber Structure, Suitable For Dry Mopping Or Damp Mopping, Smart To Use. Vacuum Cleaner Suitable For Wooden Floors,","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41l+Y3BhZzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iVacuum","source_asin":"B08M3DZ9P9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M3DZ9P9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M3DZ9P9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
