window.products.push({"id":728621,"name":"Lagute SnapHook Hook Free Fabric Floral Shower Curtain for Modern Bathroom with Snap-in Liner & See Through Top Window, Machine Washable | Hotel Grade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fnmetlhSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hook Free Design & Easy to Install: Hanging up shower curtain has never been easier! Effortlessly hook up the shower curtain on rod within seconds thanks to its creative \"SnapHook hook free design. The snap-in design can also prevent falling off by accidental pulling. Replaceable PEVA Liner & Weighted Hem: The PEVA shower curtain liner is removable with its snap-in buckles(Replacement liners are available separately ). And the weighted magnets at the bottom can keep the liner in place and away from your body. Easy to Clean & Care: The 100% polyester outer shower curtain is machine washable for easy care. The PEVA snap-in liner can be cleaned with a quick rinse or wipe after a shower. *Only iron the outer curtain.* Bright & Clean Shower: The mesh sheer window allows plenty of light comes in the shower while keeping privacy. The see-through panel also helps water evaporation and let the curtain dries out quickly. Eco-friendly & Vivid Floral Pattern: Made with premium 100% polyester fabric, the double layers bath curtain adopts eco-friendly digital printing. The vivid flower pattern design brings you a fresh and delightful feeling and is easily matched with any style of the bathroom such as modern, farmhouse, rustic style. Great for bathroom decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fnmetlhSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lagute","source_asin":"B0BN3X6398","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN3X6398","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN3X6398","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728622,"name":"Mini Fridge Portable Thermoelectric Cooler and Warmer for Skincare, Eco Friendly Beauty Fridge For Foods,Medications, Cosmetics, Breast Milk, Medicati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YBk23GvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLISH DESIGN: With stylish design compatible well with any decor of your room, perfect combination with other accessories. It is the perfect addition to any home or office and it is also great for taking out and about camping or travelling. Made from strong and durable food grade materials, the fridge is designed to last and look great at the same time. COOLING & WARMING: The Thermoelectric System in the Caynel mini fridge allows for easy switching from beverage cooler to food warmer! Easily choose to chill up to 45ºF or warm up to 140ºF - with the flip of a switch. Well insulated interior holds temperature even after unplugged. PORTABLE DESIGN: The mini fridge can be easily carried using. Ideal for home, car, caravan, boat, office, bedroom and perfect for picnics. It covers all your bases! AC and DC power cords are included for indoor or outdoor use. Easy to go from indoor 110V (AC) to car use by plugging the appliance into the car cigarette 12V (DC) adapter. ECO FRIENDLY & SAFE: 100% Freon-Free and Eco Friendly; approved with advanced safety technology for long lasting durability. The fridge features a brush-less high-grade fan motor with the ability to perform quieter and to last longer than ever before! SPECIFICATION & WARRANTY: Unit measures: 9.25\" L x 11.41\" W x 13.19\" H and weighs 8.3 lbs. The Inner dimensions: 7.16\" L x 6.69\" W x 10.9 \" H, Cooling Capacity: 40ºF-45ºF below ambient temperature, Warming Capacity: 122ºF-144ºF. ETL approved with advanced safety technology for long-lasting durability, 1-year hassle-free warranty provided by Caynel. For information on how to use your product, scroll down for a PDF user guide.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YBk23GvFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAYNEL","source_asin":"B07ZNKMMDR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZNKMMDR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZNKMMDR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
