window.products.push({"id":728716,"name":"Slappa SL-D2I-DVD Storage Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J7lw0zBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The HardBody 360 PRO CD Case is built to be the best disc storage case available. Perfect for home storage, DJ's and studio use, the HardBody 360 features SLAPPA's patented d2 pocket system, which are \"layered pockets\" (one on top of another) allowing you to store your disc in the rear pocket and your cover art (or liner notes) in the front pocket. The HardBody 360 has a total 360 pockets, so if you store your discs and your covers you will store 180 discs and 180 covers or 360 discs (if covers are not stored). Our patented d2 pockets enable you to store your covers and discs, save tons of space (VS. jewel cases) and easily identify your discs when flipping through the pages of the case. All our d2 pockets are hand stitched, not sonic sealed, which means the quality is unlike anything you've seen with most any other brand of disc storage. SLAPPA HardBody cases feature our molded Duro-Shock xEVA shell, which protects your collection (we've even had multiple customers who have had house fires and the cases protected their discs!). SLAPPA d2 pages use polypropylene 'windows', insuring your covers (or discs) will NOT stick to the pockets. In addition, soft, non-woven waffle panels keep discs completely protected from scratches. Finally, two industrial strength zippers with molded rubber zipper pullers mean your case will open and close with ease. Each case ships with 2 spine labels for cataloging and a disc cleaning cloth. - d2 pages are designed to store CD and cover - they do NOT hold plastic jewel cases","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J7lw0zBHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slappa","source_asin":"B003SP6P30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003SP6P30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003SP6P30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728717,"name":"Salton Westclox 1925 Lasalle Big Ben Clock with Pewter Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HTDKY8RAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Westclox began manufacturing the Big Ben in 1908, thereby launching one of the longest running products in American history. The replica available today is bears a masterful likeness of its 1925 Big Ben predecessor. The full metal case and base are finished in pewter and accented by a metallic finished cream dial. It also features many modern conveniences as an independent alarm time indicator and a quartz analog movement and pleasant 'beep' alarm sound. Amazon.com Complete the retro urban home look with this fabulous vintage-style clock. Inspired by the 1925 Big Ben look, Westclox's 1925 LaSalle Big Ben replica comes housed in a round pewter-finished case with a round pewter-finished base and glass lens. The face features large, plain, black numbers on a cream-colored background and includes a cut-in window showing for what time the alarm is set. Though retro is the name of the game here, the alarm clock includes modern conveniences like a top-side alarm shut-off feature and quartz analog movement. At a slight 4.75 by 4 by 2.875 inches, the clock will leave plenty of room on the bedside table for a book, reading glasses, lamp, and whatever else one needs. The clock also displays fabulously on the mantelpiece, in the office, or kitchen. As an added incentive, the clock is small enough to take along when traveling. --Betsy Herring","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HTDKY8RAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Salton","source_asin":"B00013K7AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00013K7AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00013K7AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
