window.products.push({"id":728753,"name":"Benooa Electric Heating Lunch Box,3 in 1 Heated Lunch Box for Adults,60W 12/24/110V Leakproof Portable Food Warmer Heater for Car Truck Office Home Wi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713vpcou1wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 in 1 Electric Lunch Box】Our electric lunch box food heater easily solves the problem of standing in line for hot meals or eating cold fast food, so you can enjoy hot meals anytime, anywhere! This electric lunch box supports 110V home/office + 12V car and 24V truck use, perfect for truck drivers, workers, commuters etc. Plug it in 30 minutes to 50 minutes before your meal to heat it up, so you can enjoy a warm and healthy meal. 【60W Faster Heating】The electric lunch box uses the latest design of PTC thermostatic heating, using 60W high power. The low power consumption and high efficiency circulation heating design heats up your lunch quickly while keeping the food hydrated and fresh. No more need to eat unhealthy sandwiches and fast food. At offices and construction sites, you can have fresh, warm, home-cooked meals in no time! Make it easy for you to have a healthy eating style. 【Double layer leak-proof design & easy to carry】Sealing and leak-proof are the key points of our heated lunch box. We designed four side snaps, and with the built-in rubber seal, you never have to worry about liquid food spilling out during transportation. What's more, the electric lunch box comes complete with accessories, complete with spoon, fork, foil insulation bag and anti-burn handle design, making it easy to carry anywhere you want to go. 【Removable & Easy to Clean】The portable heated lunch box is made of high quality PP plastic and 304 stainless steel, safe and durable. The large capacity food heating lunch box contains a 1.5L removable stainless steel container, a 0.45L plastic box for storing fruits and a 50ml sauce condiment box that can be used to separate different kinds of food to meet diverse dining needs. They are all removable and dishwasher safe. Note: Do not wash external lunch box with water directly. 【Buy it, Love it, Give it】 Portable lunch warmers are great for cars, trucks, offices, journeys, picnics and other kinds of indoor and outdoor use. It is not only a perfect gift for your husband, boyfriend, father and friends, but also a must-have for your own journey or on the go. If you have any questions about our electric lunch box, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a satisfactory reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713vpcou1wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Benooa","source_asin":"B09PV2X1FL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PV2X1FL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PV2X1FL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
