window.products.push({"id":728795,"name":"Bento Box, Lunch Box Kids, 1300ML Bento Box Adult Lunch Box with 4 Compartment&Food Picks Cake Cups, Lunch Box Containers for Adults/Kids/Toddler, Lea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713O63UOTTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4 Compartments Lunch Box】The bento box is designed 8.9*6.4*2.6 inches, 1300ml with 4-compartment that can separate different foods like basic food, fresh fruit, vegetables, snacks etc. It’s great to get a balanced diet and maintain the original flavor of the food. Perfectly portioned for not only the appetite of kids but also adults. 【Premium Material】The lunch box and accessories are made of high quality food-grade material(grade 5 PP material) , non-toxic, BPA free. The material is thicker, stronger, more stain resistant, environmental and drop resistant. It's your ideal daily lunch containers! 【Leak-proof Bento Lunch Box】The thicken silicone strip inside the lid is sealed well and make it 100% leak-proof. Design with 4 locking clips are easier for your kids to open and close, meanwhile, hold the lid tightly to prevent any spills from leaking in the bag and keep your food fresh & tidy. 【Microwave&Dishwasher Safe】Please do remove the lid before heating in the microwave or washing in the dishwasher. When you gonna have food, simply place the tray in the microwave and reheat food for 2-4 minutes and 248℉.Once finished, just put the compartment tray in the dishwasher on the top shelf (hand washing is recommended for the lid to avoid any deformation caused by high temperature and pressure washing) 【Bento Box Accessories Kit】You will get 4pcs reusable silicone cake cups and a sauce container - if you want to take more than 4 kinds of food and don’t want to mix them together, the cake cups and sauce box will help divide perfectly. Besides, you will get 10pcs cute animal food picks that will help encourage kids to try different food and keep your little one’s fingers clean. 【Warm Tips】①Not for children under 3 yrs. ②The lid will be a little tight when you open it at first time, which is normal and after couple of times to open it, it will get loosen. ③Do not put liquid sauce or soup into the bento box to prevent it from flowing to other compartments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713O63UOTTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yumuk","source_asin":"B0BL2Y755T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL2Y755T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL2Y755T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
