window.products.push({"id":728914,"name":"15 Feet - MRbrew Homebrew Beer Line Tubing, 3/16\" ID 7/16\" OD Clear Vinyl Tubing Draft Beer Dispensing Food Grade Hose for Kegerator, Beer Tower, D Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R2PXlI73L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Long 15 Feet Tubing for Multiple Keg Dispensing: compared to other brewing hose kits, MRbrew carbonation beer dispensing hose features a great length of 15 feet, you can apply this hose to your sankey keg tap system and cornelius ball lock kegging system simultaneously by cutting this 15 feet hose, this pretty long homebrew beer line can be cut into multiple sections to meet your mutiple kegging needs perfectly. Can be Easily Cut by Cutting Tool: the short length brewing hose kit can not be cut and it can not be applied to your multiple keg dispensing process simultaneously, or the fixed hose fitting kit comes with extra fittings and you need to spend extra money, this 15 feet kegging brewing hose can be cut into any length to meet your needs, you can can equip it with your own brewing dispensing parts, brings great convenience and creative possibilities for your multi-kegging brewing dispensing system. Powerful No Leaking Beer Dispensing Tubing: the inside diameter of this great long kegging dispensing hose is 3/16'', thick enough hose wall prevents the beer tubing kinks and maintains hose shape stability, smoothly transfer beverage without leakage with the help of hose clamps. you can attach this kegerator hose to the 3/16'' beer barb fitting connector to dispense your brewing beer from your beer keg. Reliable Durable PVC Plastic: this 15 feet keg draft beer dispensing line is made of healthy plastic, will not rot, swell, dry out, no ordors and unaffected by normal cleaning compounds, strong oil resistance, smooth surface makes cleaning easy, will not bring strange smell to your beverages, keeps pure beverage taste. Great Versatility and Widely Used: you can attach this 15 feet beer brewing hose to ball lock quick disconnect fittings to dispense carbonation beer, kombucha and other beverage at outdoor picnic, party, etc, you also can use this hose at garden activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R2PXlI73L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MRbrew","source_asin":"B09HC2K8WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HC2K8WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HC2K8WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
