window.products.push({"id":728938,"name":"Stan Lee Avengers: Infinity War Cast Autographed Signed 8x10 Photo Reprint #46 Special Unique Gifts Ideas for Him Her Best Friends Birthday Christmas ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d1DtLEccL._AC_SL1011_.jpg","description":"The photo comes FRAMED in a 9x12 inch (approx) high quality wooden frame which can be hanged portrait or landscape on your wall or sit proudly on your tableThis photo has been professionally reproduced from an original hand signed item. It is printed on high quality 250 gsm Glossy Photo Paper that will last years!Why pay for an expensive autograph when you can get a professionally produced reprint at a much lower price which looks just as good!Order shipped within 1 working day!Great Unique Gift Idea!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d1DtLEccL._AC_SL1011_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Superb Reprints","source_asin":"B07JCHYPB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JCHYPB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JCHYPB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728939,"name":"Factory Entertainment Batman 1966 TV Series Batcave Desktop Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":879.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pbUVxUIPL._AC_.jpg","description":"TO THE BATCAVE! Those three words evoke one of the most memorable interior locations in pop culture. Batman's sanctuary, his base of operations, the nerve center of his activities - a mysterious subterranean lair that is equal-parts forbidding and exciting. The Batcave has enjoyed many iterations over the years, both in print and on screen. One of the most enduring and iconic was the version that featured in the classic 1966 Batman TV series. As children, the Team at Factory Entertainment were among the millions of fans who dreamed of visiting the classic TV series Batcave (who wouldn't?). Alas, that dream never came to pass, but our fascination with the Batcave never faded. Now, at long last, we are proud to be able to offer our fellow Bat-fans the opportunity to own a scaled version of our favorite location. We hope you enjoy being the master of your own Batcave as much as we enjoyed creating it. In practical terms, there was not one Batcave set. Rather, it was a series of ever-changing sets that would physically morph from scene to scene and season to season. It was a 'live' set that evolved regularly. Because of the many variations in the Batcave seen on screen, our model does not attempt to duplicate a particular arrangement from a given episode or a specific scene. Rather it replicates the “feel\" of the Batcave set as it is most commonly seen. The inclusion of movable elements allows you to customize the look of the cave around a core group of fixed parts, including the prominent 'atomic pile,' which are presented in their most common positions. The classic Batman TV series Batcave was a riot of color, with a uniquely 1960's atheistic. Each model contains more than 16 different LED lights, in a variety of hues, both fixed and animated, that bring the Batcave to life, including: Hidden floor lights, to emulate the large floodlights with colored gels that were used on set, a pulsating color change effect inside the Atomic Core and flashing lights in select monitors and screens. The model is powered by 6 AAA batteries and lights are independently controlled by two separate circuits with on/off switches. The product has been meticulously hand-painted with period correct colors that were thoroughly researched and includes scaled replicas of the most important signage and graphics. This model is not a static piece; it features a host of moving parts including: A turntable that can be manually rotated, selected movable furniture that allows you to dress the set as you prefer, and a faux rock door panel in the entrance tunnel that can be removed to allow access entry by the Batmobile. (Batmobile model not included). The model measures an impressive 18\" x 14\" x 9\" (45cm x 35cm x 22cm) and weighs in at over 20lbs. It comes in a collector box and includes a combined booklet and certificate of authenticity that tells the story of the original set and the replica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pbUVxUIPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Factory Entertainment","source_asin":"B078SG6K62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078SG6K62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078SG6K62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728940,"name":"Convenient One-Touch Portable Blender with USB Rechargeable and Intelligent Lock Protection,13 oz Personal Blender for Shakes and Smoothies,Made with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVSuH0m0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Portable Blender is automatic blender, cordless blender,USB battery blender.Portable Blender is suitable for kitchen,outdoor and travelling. It's an on the go blender and made of BPA-free material.Choose our Portable Blender,creating silky-smooth superfood smoothies has never been s imper! Operating the Portable Blender: 1. Unscrew the cap and add water and fruit. 2. Tighten the cap. 3. Inverted fuseclage so that the fruit is not stuck on the blade. 4. Press the button for 2 seconds and the machine starts to run. 5. Turn the fuselage upside down and rock slowly up and down. Warning： 1.Please read the contents of this manual before using it. 2.Motor seat can't be soaked in water, in order to avoid the risk of leakage. 3. Do not touch rotation of component. 4.Container material should not exceed 2/3 of container, tighten cup cover when using. 5. During the stirring process, when the machine is stuck with food, please turn off the power and remove the stuck hard matter and reboot. 6.Portable Blender shouldn ’t be stirred meat, cannot directly grind dried fruit and beans products, direct grinding will cause product failure to affect the product life . 7.Please drink in time, long-term storage will produce odour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVSuH0m0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELenest","source_asin":"B0BLR8DM6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLR8DM6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLR8DM6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
