window.products.push({"id":728962,"name":"Real Silk Pillowcase 25 Momme King Size, Anvo 100% Mulberry Silk Pillow Case Grade 6A for Hair and Skin with Hidden Zipper, 1PC, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMoIrzuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE THIS SILK PILLOWCASE? 💓MILLIONS+ HAPPY CUSTOMERS. 💓6A Grade 100% Pure Natural Mulberry Silk, both side 25 momme, 900 thread count. 💓OEKO-TEX Standard 100 Certified. 💓Hypoallergenic, breathable, comfortable, smooth, soft, cool. 💓Moisture keeping and facial wrinkle reducing. 💓Benefits for your hair and skin. 💓Natural temperature regulator. 💓Luxurious and durable 💓Hidden zipper and invisible stitching What You Will Get: 1 X Silk Pillowcase BENEFITS OF SILK PILLOWCASES 1. Silk pillowcases help you reduce facial wrinkles and dryness, since 100% natural mulberry silk features a much gentler and smoother texture, there is far less friction between the pillow and your hair. 2. Silk pillowcases are beneficial for your skin as well, they won’t absorb the natural moisture (or your beloved nighttime moisturizer) from your face. The softer silk pillowcases texture could cause less friction on the face, which means it’s less likely to cause fine lines, wrinkles and those annoying creases you see in the morning. INSTRUCTIONS FOR WASHING AND CARE 💡Hand wash gently in cold water or lukewarm water with mild detergent. Backside washing and dry recommended. 💡Machine wash in cold, gentle cycle or silk mode below 30℃ with mesh protective bags. 💡Wash separately from other items to avoid color mixing. Lay fat at a shady place and air dry. 💡Do not bleach and do not tumble dry. Do not twist or wring, Hang dry.Do not dry in direct sunlight. 💡Ironing is not recommended. If you must, only iron the inside of the silk pillowcase with the suitable temperature only. 🎁GREAT GIFTS FOR FAMILIES AND FRIENDS 1. Great gift choices for mom, wife, grandma, girlfriend, sister or adult daughters and everyone you care. 2. We recommend buying 2 or more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMoIrzuHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anvo","source_asin":"B095WTV893","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WTV893","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WTV893","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
