window.products.push({"id":728995,"name":"JOUALY 【Mother's Day Gifts】 3D Crystal Ball Music Box, LED Floodlight Luxury Wooden Music Box, Best Gift for Children,Women,Friends, Christma's Day/Mo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UJgmjwRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👼【The feeling of healing in a dream】Our life and work are full of troubles. The lifelike cats and apples in the crystal ball are clean and transparent, and the music box is always healed by the same sound and melody. The 3D crystal ball has a built-in fashion image, 360 degrees of any angle, full of three-dimensional feeling. Song:castle in the sky. 💡【Projection & Bed Light Multifunction】When the room light is off, place the ball on the lit crystal base to glow, and project a beautiful lotus pattern on the ceiling, full of romance. The lower the ceiling, the better the projection effect. There are 12 LED lights on the wooden base. The warm brightness distributes the light evenly on the crystal ball, which rotates with the music without glare. Because it is rechargeable, it can also be used as a bedside lamp or flashlight. 🌙【360 degree rotation & USB power supply】The crystal ball and advanced LED wooden base are separated from the structure design. The 360-degree three-dimensional ball can rotate at any angle, and the night light can also rotate. Since the battery is built into the product, it can be charged by connecting to a computer or mobile power supply through the included USB data access. Battery capacity: 1200mAh, charging time: 2-3H, lighting time: 8-12H. 🎁【Applicable to any scene】Gifts for birthdays, weddings, parties and other scenes are very successful, and they are given to relatives such as children, girlfriends, her friends and family. The tune is relaxed and immersed in a romantic atmosphere. They are very suitable for mood lights, night lights or bedside lights in children's rooms or adult bedrooms. It can also be used as a decorative light for parties, social events, etc. 🎉【Warranty】One rotation is about 12 seconds, and the repeat performance is about 1 minute. Wind the winding screw at the bottom of the music box 2-3 times to make the music box sound. Size: 10*13*7cm Material: wooden base + artificial crystal USB cable: 1.5m, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will serve you wholeheartedly. (gift box)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UJgmjwRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOUALY","source_asin":"B09PYPHLXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PYPHLXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PYPHLXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":728996,"name":"DKC-197-SETA-DS KINION CHEF Knife SET 4 Knives (2 sizes of chef, 2 sizes of Utility)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n3bfkPQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Rated Knives: DKCDKC Knives provides custom hand made Damascus Steel Folding and Fixed Blade Knives. Our knives range from hunting knives, pocket folding knives, Laguiole knives, Bowie Knives, Skinner Knives, Gut Hook Knives, Chef Knives, Kukri Knives, Ulu Knives, Scrimshaw Knives, fishing knives, and many other specialty knives. All of our knives come with a sheath. Final pieces (both the knife and sheath) may have variances from the pictures due to being hand made, natural materials, the time of day we make the knife, etc. This is the beauty of hand made knifes. Each knife takes many hours of hard work to produce..these are not machined knives ! You are getting both a piece of art as well as a functional knife ! If you care for your DKC Knife properly, it will be a family heirloom that can be handed down. In addition we offer a growing list of pocket folding knives and fixed blade knives made in 440c stainless steel and other blade materials. Natural materials (wood, bone, etc) can shift over time due to temperature and humidity....so pieces that are not a machine fit are not defects, but rather part of the natural material characteristics. DKC Knives come well lubricated (typically in oil) and need to be wiped down with a soft microfiber cloth when you receive the knife. Knives include instructions for knife care. If you have any questions or issues please contact us and we are happy to help you. We work extremely hard to put out nice knives at a reasonable price. We are a small business located here in the US and depend on your ongoing support with new knife purchases and good reviews. Please join our growing list of world wide knife collectors. Buy two or three different models and you will become hooked as many people do. Our knives are great gifts for fathers day, birthdays, graduations, anniversaries as well as many other occasions . A beautiful hand made custom knife will be remembered forever ! Thanks from all of us at DKC Knives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n3bfkPQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKC Knives","source_asin":"B07KVNSZJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-728996","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KVNSZJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KVNSZJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
